    <unit id="1" name="PageSubtitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Organize business content by date in a desktop calendar panel.</source>
        <target state="translated">在桌面日曆面板中依日期組織業務內容。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="2" name="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Calendar presents a month date grid or a year month grid with valid range, disabled dates, cell customization, and selection events.</source>
        <target state="translated">Calendar 以月日期網格或年月份網格呈現日期，支援有效範圍、停用日期、儲存格定製與選擇事件。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
